# Conventional Commits format — replace the lines below.
#
# <type>(<scope>): <short, imperative summary>
#
# <body: what changed and why — wrap at 72 chars>
#
# Types: feat | fix | perf | refactor | docs | chore | test | ci
# Scopes: ipo | mf | smart-money | overlap | tools | broker | seo | infra
#
# Examples:
#   feat(mf): add conviction score breakdown table
#   fix(seo): remove SearchAction schema blocked by robots.txt
#   perf(overlap): replace 143K staging URLs with 780 curated pairs
